3,Native American Languages in New Mexico: Keres/Keresan,https://libguides.sanjuancollege.edu/c.php?g=1467677&p=10919872,"Jun 18, 2026 · Volume 1 includes the stories in English while Volume 2 includes the stories in Keresan (probably Western Keresan). The work (Volume 1) also includes notes on culturally specific terms such as religious figures, ceremonies, and culturally signifigant animals.","Keres, Eastern",Keresan
